<title>LATVIA: Latvian unemployment up slightly mo/mo in May.</title>
<headline>Latvian unemployment up slightly mo/mo in May.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian unemployment rose slightly in May to 7.7 percent from 7.6 percent in April, the statistics committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN UNEMPLOYMENT    May '97    April '97    May '96</p>
<p> Percent		     7.7	  7.6	    7.1</p>
<p> Number unemployed	 96,200     95,000	 89,461</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
